{"id":"01a03fd5-e8c7-7bdf-ab18-ee1e420bf4d4","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: protect_response with request AAD\",\"notes\":\"Already implemented\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:07.437066Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:40:28.766306Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:08:59.07349Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:45:28.766306Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:40:28.766306Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:07.993378Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented request-bound response protection while preserving concurrent 64-bit PIV and active-slot/NVM work. Existing oscore_protect_response now emits RFC 8613 no-PIV responses and rejects duplicate construction for one request correlation; new oscore_protect_response_with_piv emits fresh response PIVs, binds nonce to responder KID/context and AAD to original request KID/PIV, persists sender sequence, and rolls back without publishing output on capacity/crypto/NVM/context-recycle failure. Added exact RFC C7/C8 vectors, round trips, replay/correlation, and NVM rollback coverage. Isolated Zephyr qemu_x86 build compiled/linked. Response-focused QEMU tests all pass: C7, C8 exact bytes, cross-response/fresh-PIV replay, malformed correlation, rollback. Broad image retains three unrelated pre-existing failures: stale NVM retry count, peer-EUI lookup expectation, and request-only roundtrip. cppcheck scoped C sources and git diff --check pass. Python OSCORE cross parity 12 passed; Rust cross_parity 4 passed/1 ignored generator helper. Concurrent OSCORE active-slot/NVM hunks were preserved.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T20:49:38.503779Z"}
